>A while back I heard there was a way in NH 3.0j
>to stash a great amount of gems in a bag of holding
>by "playing with the cursed/blessed status" of a bag
>of holding.  How is this done?  The best results I got
>is simply to bless the bag (which gives me 2* normal capacity)

>I'd appreciate it if any of you remember and post the solution.
>Thanks.

	Spoilers follow:

(The following advice given by Richard Biegel, not myself)

>My suggestion for exploiting bags of holding (i.e., cheating):
>
>repeat
>    (1) bless the bag
>    (2) fill it with heavy worthless stuff
>    (3) curse the bag
>    (4) empty it
>until bored;
>bless the bag;
>
>Now you have a blessed bag of holding with weight that is very much
>less than zero.  It should hold enormous quantities of loot.
>
>Just remember that bags of holding cause old versions of nethack to
>crash.  Be sure to copy your save files.
